      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n***Only Two 3-bedroom semi detached left***\n\nSherry FitzGerald O'Donovan are delighted to present Castlewidenham to the market. This is an exclusive development which features 25 units consisting of 15 detached and 10 semi-detached homes. Located in the picturesque village of Castletownroche within walking distance of all amenities and easy access to Fermoy and Mallow Town.\n\nProperty features includes;\n\n-High quality block built homes with premium craftmanship\n-10 year Homebond\n-Generous PC Sums\n-Eligible for Help-to-Buy\n-Eligible for First Home Scheme\n-A2 rated/Air to water/underfloor heating\n\nTo Register your interest today email mallow@sfod.ie or contact us on 022-42651"
